ode, subject code description, department name, school name, subject title, number of enrolled students, and assign row numbers within each department name group ordered by subject code, along with the coefficient of variation (using STDDEV only and never STDDEV_POP) of the number of enrolled students in the subjects offered by the Mathematics department. Do not return any rounded answers."
